 https://mail-index.netbsd.org/port-arm/2026/03/19/msg009556.html
 https://mail-index.netbsd.org/port-arm/2026/04/30/msg009598.html
  1. fdtbus: handle /chosen compatible "simple_bus" for Raspberry Pi 4
  2. aarch64/pmap: also prepare MD aarch64_mmap_flags() in PMAP_MI case
  3. bcm283x: skip bcmgenfb specific initialization in !bcmgenfb case
  4. evbarm/conf: add bcm2838pcie and bcm2838rng for Raspberry Pi 4B
  5. aarch64: fix /dev/mem mmap cookie handling for MMIO devices

